# Infrastructure

Details: `.cursor/plans/06-docker-makefile-local.md`, `07-ec2-deployment.md`.

- Docker Compose for local deps and production-like local stack.
- Root Makefile is a first-class deliverable: dev, test, seed/reset, local deploy, health/logs, EC2 deploy/status, APK build, cleanup.
- Local deploy must not require AWS credentials; EC2 deploy must not silently use localhost.
- Normal stop/deploy preserves DB volumes; destructive resets are explicit targets.
- Nginx terminates HTTP :80 on EC2; Postgres/Redis private; SSH IP-restricted.
- Real EC2 deploy only with explicit host config and user approval.
